  "plain": "Dylan Borland, a man who has come forward with claims about UFOs, says that people helping him put him in touch with the US Congress in 2023. He says he spoke with Congress a few days earlier and then, on March 3, sat in a SCIF, a secure room for discussing classified information, with congressional staffers. He tells it because, as he presents it, it would mean lawmakers' staff took his account seriously enough to hear it in secret, around the same time other whistleblowers were going to Congress."
